From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000024 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Port Bot <port@local>
Date: Thu, 18 Sep 2026 08:40:00 +0200
Subject: 0024: flag-gate the core Node Logs tab

Add a NODE_LOGS_PLUGIN_FLAG (LOGGING_PLUGIN_NODE_LOGS_ENABLED) check to
NodeDetailsPage.tsx's pagesFor, the exact shape
0020-node-terminal-flag-gate.patch already uses for the Node Terminal tab
one line below. When the `logging` console plugin's own backend reports
NODE_LOGS_ENABLED=true, it sets this flag via a console.flag extension
and contributes its own Node Logs tab (a console.tab/horizontalNav
extension, which can only add a tab, never replace one) - this patch is
the other half of that pair, letting core step aside so exactly one Node
Logs tab is ever shown. Unset (the default, including when the plugin is
installed but has NODE_LOGS_ENABLED off, which is how it ships) leaves
this tab exactly as it was, still served by core and still fixed up by
the plugin's journal fetch patch.
---
 .../src/components/nodes/NodeDetailsPage.tsx    | 14 ++++++++++++--
 1 file changed, 12 insertions(+), 2 deletions(-)

diff --git a/frontend/packages/console-app/src/components/nodes/NodeDetailsPage.tsx b/frontend/packages/console-app/src/components/nodes/NodeDetailsPage.tsx
index 777a8d4..fe7f08a 100644
